<div class="content">
    <h1>Verification Request Update</h1>

    <p>Hello {{ownerName}},</p>

    <p>
        Thank you for submitting a verification request for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong>. After careful
        review, we're unable to approve your verification at this time.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Reason for rejection:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0;">
                    {{rejectionReason}}
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- What You Can Do -->
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #004aad; padding-left: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <h3 style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    What you can do next:
                </h3>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Review the rejection reason carefully</li>
                    <li>Update your organization information as needed</li>
                    <li>Prepare the required documentation</li>
                    <li>Submit a new verification request when ready</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #ecfdf5; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>💡 Good news:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46; margin: 0;">
                    This doesn't affect your ability to create and manage events. You can continue using all core
                    features of Orgatick while working on your verification requirements.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {{> button
    url=reapplyUrl
    label="Submit New Verification Request"
    variant="primary"
    fullWidth=true
    marginTop="20px"
    marginBottom="20px"
    }}

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    If you have any questions about this decision or need clarification, please don't hesitate to
                    contact our support team. We're here to help!
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 10px 0 0 0;">
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
